# NOTICE — lineage

GSM2Computer is derived from [pulpoff/gsm2sip](https://github.com/pulpoff/gsm2sip), the original Android GSM-SIP gateway (Magisk priv-app, SIP bridge, device mixer profiles).

This repo takes that codebase’s WebSocket stream path and GSM audio plumbing, removes SIP/SignalWire/Twilio signalling, and retargets the product at streaming GSM calls to a hub computer.

